      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مَرْمَثَةٌ</span></b>  [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْمِثَةٌ</span>] <i>Land producing</i>
